# Server (Hono + Zod)

Stack is **Hono + Zod**, not NestJS. Follow the module recipe under `server/src/modules/` (e.g. `prompts/`).

## Layers

`routes` (Hono + `@hono/zod-validator`) → `schema` (Zod) → `service` → `repository` / `file-store`

- Keep business logic out of routes; validate input with Zod schemas.
- Reuse `server/src/shared/` for errors, ids, pagination — do not copy-paste.

## API shape

```typescript
// ✅ Success
return c.json({ item });
return c.json({ items });

// ✅ Errors via isAppError → { error, code }
// Mount new modules in register-modules.ts on BOTH /api/v1 and /api
```

## Domain boundaries

- `video-production` — pipelines, steps, ports/adapters (no HTTP UI concerns)
- `video-production-ui` — HTTP API for the console
- `llm-browser` — infrastructure + module routes; do not mix browser automation into UI pages
